It does not relicense code, assets, names, or other material owned by parties
who have not granted GPLv3 rights.

## Provenance summary

This project is described as a reverse-engineered source port of Heretic II
(1998, Raven Software). The source tree contains material with several different
provenance categories, including:

- files that carry `Copyright 1998 Raven Software` notices;
- code whose commit history indicates origin from the Heretic II Toolkit v1.06;
- reverse-engineered or reconstructed engine, renderer, client, and support code;
- later project-specific contributions by Heretic2R / Heretic II Remastered
  contributors;
- third-party libraries such as SDL3, stb, glad, and libsmacker, each under its
  own license terms as stated in those files or accompanying notices.

The repository is not an official source-code release from Raven Software,
Activision, Microsoft, id Software, or any other Heretic II rights holder unless
such permission is documented separately.

